---
source: crates/assist-core/src/dialog.rs
expression: "transcript(Arc::clone(&full),\n&[\"open firefox\", \"close it\", \"$ ls -la\", \"run build\",\n\"open firefox and search rust tokio\",])"
---
> open firefox
! open_app: app = firefox
> close it
